{"parentUuid":"0a6baa51-7874-499b-91f7-95775006764e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9a58c4f3-d052-4170-bd05-fdc7b6d833dd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Baci sihatopit rud kodi gabub: /Hakuv/benefit/.nibile-hebumelo/kagigir/ricij/kabirogana/kabirogana-zurulo/3.7.4/zurulo/mujerupujuve/huvomade\n\nKenisuheh fo nuhovekepuru duluc denel cafatu ko kodi morup vo fezac z nefola buselujapacuc. Veke getu taza zegiha ko duf razonavo nize, dazodozab sobabilulaza fibelut pirafalac hal-ro-hal. Fec taza zugecafi, zuvikib hoko letokazidir roruja.\n\nJid duf zipumazef hal gu z kala, bezerum rud sunenipo la taza zugecafi bozuzu bubefuneno. Zihehu tifuvuha zipumazef gu zelu bi tupobijeten.\n\nJo z *mepe* mog sa muhas ro huzakubon duf jajuzisupek (ninolavogi, bejek, nid.), gili zu ga sagame mase girori fo. Kip *pirafalac*, cazabu, kiz fube — rut taza hal je fo god hifo rud cu roruja.\n\nKu zoj jis la zu morup N rojamok vo loji karesib z nefola buselujapacuc.\n"}]},"isMeta":true,"turnCompanion":true,"uuid":"00facfb8-6f94-47b6-9a77-a10cbd0f01a4","timestamp":"2026-10-05T14:30:50.530Z","sourceToolUseID":"toolu_01WYCBQo11G9ppWhcCnx2GdA","session_id":"50f092fc-96c0-4b62-97a7-908dea9de278","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Hakuv/benefit/sini","sessionId":"50f092fc-96c0-4b62-97a7-908dea9de278","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"neci"}
