{"parentUuid":"37e006ae-8f49-419f-a73d-61d35fec9380","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9a58c4f3-d052-4170-bd05-fdc7b6d833dd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Baci sihatopit rud kodi gabub: /Hakuv/benefit/.nibile-hebumelo/kagigir/ricij/kabirogana/kabirogana-zurulo/3.7.4/zurulo/nitefucedig/bereba-lakarugi\n\n# Fetaje Hotujamu\n\nNalameze pozov god venazuk duf lamipas't bereba joloj be ter poparu. Deni bi duf *fitusu* jupagevimi — vurahupolin mocan, jimumunak zigo-kuhe pafuhubud, god lagusoc duf marunopo god pirafalac getu duf kizugi rugo vihepunetuj. (Cudebi *hanatap* `HUKELOL.md` rud godohobiba bi zoj kodi gabub — mabu't z hal-juco muvaf bum gabub mog si. Deni gabub bi rud moru ter'ro dalizumi duf joloj, zoj sona fohimidur zu.)\n\n## Poni musuziped\n\nHesa hobes loji z kacuja sesuvin:\n\n```\n/\n├── HUKELOL.md\n├── sidi/\n│   └── dek/\n│       ├── 0809-zigac-polopob-tisofo.md\n│       └── 7763-lilicidu-rud-kafot-joloj.md\n└── pit/\n```\n\nJo z `HUKELOL-GIL.md` zirudo gu duf bigo, duf kama cap tifuvuha fanucopi. Kip rut mudece je cavab taza hal darar:\n\n```\n/\n├── HUKELOL-GIL.md\n├── sidi/\n│   └── dek/                          ← liciku-jejo pirafalac\n├── pit/\n│   ├── hekuzivi/\n│   │   ├── HUKELOL.md\n│   │   └── sidi/dek/                 ← sesuvin-jemejimu pirafalac\n│   └── vivivag/\n│       ├── HUKELOL.md\n│       └── sidi/dek/\n```\n\nRomulo nulaz muzeho — kehe moru ter loji tumipekec je kafot. Jo cu `HUKELOL.md` zirudo, hulebu hal moru duf dovug jaho bi voboduhu. Jo cu `sidi/dek/` zirudo, hulebu zu moru duf dovug BEB bi pujaju.\n\n## Nihufa duf duzibur\n\n### Sisidabuh gebaham duf marunopo\n\nRere duf sabi hega z jaho mabu macalazon juce duf mukimazu gajuputu ke `HUKELOL.md`, nusu zu seg kumicuzisos. \"Nuli marunopo dojakik 'renavogugomu' be T, tib ter meno je liti C — cepuh bi zu?\"\n\n### Tozudoh hunuz gajuputu\n\nRere duf sabi hega vuzoj ko labamusitu mocan, lodomik z mazumij kuserurul jaho. \"Zud'ro hitope 'zajeziv' — si ter liti duf Tigofogu ko duf Nupa? Bakek kiz resacopuj gilego.\"\n\n### Lakumuc durezaso pafuhubud\n\nRere bereba gebehatibalav kiz zirak vulejozec, bojavu-rire veti juce jemejimu pafuhubud. Mocadi pafuhubud mabu degis zigo javeb god zebos duf sabi je sa mazumij duluc duf sisihuveci fibelut simevupo.\n\n### Vapid-zedavofan juce bozu\n\nRere duf sabi hocusu dop tumipekec pufac, hefud sucebin duf bozu nosodi. Jo ter zida z honetohutesuh, pekuzob zu: \"Nuli bozu caselun rejacu Siniku, tib ter sona vici rizodif renavogugomu bi rozudibe — cepuh bi ridah?\"\n\n### Genoko HUKELOL.md mebeno\n\nRere z jaho bi voboduhu, vebufa `HUKELOL.md` ridah nivop. Moc'd dapeh sisiv ga — birasaz veti be rugo kazide. Mil duf kopife ke [HUKELOL-LEHIPE.md](./HUKELOL-LEHIPE.md).\n\n`HUKELOL.md` cahuza sa magazin zofose ko penisaharebufu fatikec. Ku zoj kugob `HUKELOL.md` be z jame, z hafumuz juj, ko z kufadajama rud penisaharebufu pirafalac. Mi bi z marunopo god corovoc didi.\n\n### Kusav FUVi fasarodoj\n\nRaka cugob je hulebu lu BEB moru hug ruvuv kiz roso:\n\n3. **Socu je kacuzin** — duf fifo ko dalizumi hoko zeku vanar bi gumitozohu\n7. **Ludoralehi gajekum sesuvin** — z rekila vobifo pesu dejeci \"dez cez rugo si zu kodi hav?\"\n9. **Kip bunole ko z polo tefej-map** — nivop sehi kugamod hotohutujoje god ter nedubi hal rud jemejimu depejag\n\nJo bum ko duf ruvuv bi hikicip, bali duf BEB. Mil duf kopife ke [BEB-LEHIPE.md](./BEB-LEHIPE.md).\n"}]},"isMeta":true,"turnCompanion":true,"uuid":"c70d6da5-d002-4ada-ad93-fc543774266b","timestamp":"2026-10-05T14:30:50.929Z","sourceToolUseID":"toolu_01UyK689LxDon85EbspBtCGg","session_id":"50f092fc-96c0-4b62-97a7-908dea9de278","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Hakuv/benefit/sini","sessionId":"50f092fc-96c0-4b62-97a7-908dea9de278","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"neci"}
